<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<app version="1">
  <name>WiiBrowser Lite (development)</name>
  <coder>gave92, Bastiro03 and contributors</coder>
  <version>@VERSION@</version>
  <release_date>@RELEASE_DATE@</release_date>
  <short_description>Experimental web browser for Wii.</short_description>
  <long_description>Development build, not release-cleared. Basic HTML/CSS rendering,
HTTP/HTTPS, links, URL-encoded forms, bookmarks and SD/USB downloads. HTTPS requires
the included cacert.pem beside boot.dol and a correct console clock.

Wii Remote: point and A to select, D-pad to scroll, B+IR to drag-scroll,
Plus/Minus to open/close the page toolbar, HOME to exit. Console RESET returns to
Wii Menu; POWER shuts down. Classic/GC input needs hardware verification.

PNG/JPEG images only. No JavaScript, file uploads, archive extraction, self-update,
forwarder or video playback. Downloads use .part files; failed transfers retain
them. Existing files are replaced only after confirmation and backup. See README
for recovery of .new/.bak files and known limitations.</long_description>
</app>
